  "notes": {
    "n1": {
      "fill": "orange",
      "maxH": 420,
      "text": "Phone contacts are on by default. Google and iCloud are optional. iCloud has no Android sign-in, so it uses CardDAV with an Apple app-specific password. Sources can be Combined (one list) or Separate (one list per source).",
      "w": 320,
      "x": 1880,
      "y": 0
    },
    "n2": {
      "fill": "teal",
      "maxH": 420,
      "text": "Custom dates (a pet's gotcha day, a memorial) get their own name, icon and tile color. Home is a tile grid. Today is a hero tile. Every picture gets a random expressive shape. No photo means initials. The top bar is frosted glass. There is no bottom nav: Settings opens from the top bar. Tap a tile for the person's dates, reminder style, source and move/merge.",
      "w": 320,
      "x": 2820,
      "y": 1250
    },
    "n3": {
      "fill": "pink",
      "maxH": 420,
      "text": "At 7:00 AM one grouped notification lists everyone. Silent people appear without sound. People set to Off never show. Wish opens a message picker by category, then the Android share sheet so any messaging app works.",
      "w": 320,
      "x": 2350,
      "y": 2500
    },
    "n4": {
      "fill": "purple",
      "maxH": 420,
      "text": "Message templates live inside Settings (Friends, Family, Colleagues, with {name} and {age} placeholders). Send a wish picks a template and hands it to any messaging app, where you edit and send it. Settings also holds reminder time, event types, theme and sources.",
      "w": 320,
      "x": 1880,
      "y": 3750
    },
    "n5": {
      "fill": "red",
      "maxH": 420,
      "text": "No dates: contacts exist but none has a date, so offer to add a birthday. No contacts: offer Google, iCloud or manual entry. Blocked: Contacts, Notifications and Exact alarms each get a fix, with a manual-entry way forward.",
      "w": 320,
      "x": 1410,
      "y": 5000
    },
    "n6": {
      "fill": "orange",
      "maxH": 420,
      "text": "Short pull and release opens the Earlier section above Today: older events are grouped by month, with the last two weeks nearest Today, all in grayscale. Long pull and release refreshes contacts and iCloud. Search shows an X once you type; contacts with no dates appear under 'No dates yet'. 'Back to today' returns to the top.",
      "w": 320,
      "x": 3360,
      "y": 6250
    },
